ween bank escrow accounts before fraudsters withdraw them at ATMs.",step2Title:"2. Block Cards & UPI with Your Bank",step2Desc:"Use the verified bank directory below to block cards, net banking, and UPI channels immediately.",step3Title:"3. Preserve Evidence",step3Desc:"Keep transaction SMS, debit alert messages, and fraud phone numbers. Do not delete them.",step4Title:"4. Never Disclose Remaining Passwords",step4Desc:"Legitimate police and bank officers will NEVER ask for your OTP, UPI PIN, ATM PIN, or passwords.",warningNeverShare:"\u26a0\ufe0f CRITICAL WARNING: Legitimate bank staff, police, and helpline 1930 will NEVER ask for your OTP, UPI PIN, passwords, or card CVV. Never share credentials.",noAutoFreezeDisclaimer:"\u26a0\ufe0f Important: ScamShield cannot automatically freeze your account or make calls. You must call your bank or 1930 directly.",familyNoticeTitle:"Prepared Emergency Message for Family",familyNoticeDesc:"Quickly notify your trusted children or family members so they can assist you immediately. Tap to copy or share.",templateFraudAlert:"\ud83d\udea8 Urgent Fraud Alert to Family",templateVerifyRequest:"\u2753 Verify Suspicious Message / Call",familyDetailsPlaceholder:"Optional: Describe what happened (e.g. \u20b95,000 debited, suspicious electricity call)",shareFamilyNoticeButton:"\ud83d\udce4 Share Alert with Family",copyFamilyNoticeButton:"\ud83d\udccb Copy Family Message Template",familyNoticeCopied:"Family message template copied to clipboard! Paste it into WhatsApp or SMS.",bankDirectoryTitle:"Official Bank Emergency Helplines",bankDirectoryDesc:"Call your bank's verified toll-free fraud helpline immediately to freeze your debit card, UPI, or net banking.",bankSearchPlaceholder:"Search verified bank name...",bankNotFoundTitle:"Bank Not Found in Directory?",bankNotFoundDesc:"Check the verified toll-free number printed on the back of your physical Debit Card or bank passbook. NEVER search for bank customer care numbers on Google search ads.",confirmBankDialTitle:"Call {{bankName}} Fraud Helpline?",confirmBankDialMessage:"This will open your phone dialer to call {{bankName}} at {{phoneNumber}} to block your account or card.",confirmBankDialAction:"Call Bank Now",bankFreezeTitle:"Freeze Bank Account / UPI",prepareMessage:"Prepare Bank Freeze Notice",reviewNotice:"Review prepared message before sending",freezeNoticeTitle:"Prepare Bank Freeze Notice",freezeNoticeDesc:"Generate a standardized urgent notice to send to your bank branch or customer care. ScamShield NEVER sends silent messages.",bankNameLabel:"Bank Name",bankNamePlaceholder:"e.g., State Bank of India, HDFC Bank",accountDigitsLabel:"Last 4 Digits of Account / Card",accountDigitsPlaceholder:"e.g., 4321",incidentTypeLabel:"Incident Type",incidentUnauthorizedUpi:"Unauthorized UPI Debit / Transfer",incidentSharedOtp:"Shared OTP / PIN Under Pressure",incidentClickedLink:"Clicked Fraudulent Link / Installed APK",incidentOther:"Other Financial Fraud Suspicion",generateNoticeButton:"\ud83d\udcdd Generate Bank Freeze Notice",preparedNoticeLabel:"Standardized Bank Freeze Notice",copyNoticeButton:"\ud83d\udccb Copy Notice to Clipboard",noticeCopied:"Notice copied to clipboard! Paste it into your email, SMS, or bank support ticket.",privacyGuarantee:"GUARANTEE: ScamShield never sends silent SMS or interacts with your bank. You review and send the notice yourself.",errorSelectBank:"Please enter or select your bank name.",errorDigits:"Please enter the last 4 digits of your account or card."},familyCircle:{title:"Family Safety Circle",subtitle:"Consent-Based Caregiver Protection",consentTitle:"Consent-First Family Protection",consentDesc:"Connect a trusted son, daughter, or family member. They will receive high-level safety notifications if a serious scam attempt is detected on your phone.",inviteCardTitle:"Invite Trusted Family Member",caregiverNameLabel:"Family Member's Full Name",caregiverNamePlaceholder:"e.g., Rahul Sharma",caregiverRelationLabel:"Relationship",caregiverRelationPlaceholder:"e.g., Son, Daughter, Grandchild, Spouse",consentCheckboxLabel:"I give explicit permission to share high-risk scam alerts and simulator learning stats with this family member.",consentError:"You must check the consent box to authorize invitation and alert sharing.",nameRequiredError:"Please enter your family member's name.",statusNotPaired:"Not Connected to a Family Member",statusPending:"Pairing Code Active (Waiting for Caregiver)",statusActive:"Connected & Guarded by Caregiver",generateCodeButton:"\ud83d\udd11 Generate 6-Digit Pairing Code",pairingCodeLabel:"Your 6-Digit Pairing Code",pairingCodeExpires:"Valid for 15 minutes. Share this code with your trusted caregiver.",shareCodeHint:"Ask your family member to enter this code in their ScamShield Family companion app.",shareInviteButton:"\ud83d\udce4 Share Invitation Code via WhatsApp / SMS",copyCodeButton:"\ud83d\udccb Copy Pairing Code",cloudRelayTitle:"Cloud Synchronization Status",cloudRelayStatus:"Cloud Relay Server: Offline / Local Mode. Remote push alerts require cloud relay server infrastructure. Local consent pairing code active.",manualConfirmTitle:"Confirm Pairing Manually",manualConfirmDesc:"If your caregiver has verified the code on their device, confirm their connection below:",manualConfirmButton:"\u2713 Confirm Caregiver Connected",caregiverRelationDisplay:"Relationship: {{relation}}",pairedAtDisplay:"Guarding your device with care.",activeCaregiverLabel:"Active Trusted Caregiver",caregiverGuardingSince:"Guarding your device with care.",revokeButton:"\u2715 Revoke Caregiver Access",revokeConfirmTitle:"Revoke Caregiver Access?",revokeConfirmMessage:"Are you sure you want to disconnect {{caregiverName}}? They will no longer receive any security alerts regarding this device.",revokeConfirmAction:"Disconnect Caregiver",simulatePairingButton:"Simulate Caregiver Connection (Demo)",minimalSharingTitle:"Minimal Data Shared with Caregiver",minimalSharingDesc:"Only high-level security summaries are shared to protect your dignity and complete privacy:",sharedItem1:"\u2022 High-Risk Threat Alerts (Blocked predatory scams only)",sharedItem2:"\u2022 Scam Simulator Learning Progress & Reflex Score",privacyTitle:"Strict Senior Privacy Guarantee",privacyWhatCaregiverSeesTitle:"What your caregiver CAN see:",privacyWhatCaregiverSees1:"\u2022 Whether ScamShield protection is active and threat database is updated.",privacyWhatCaregiverSees2:"\u2022 High-level alerts when a high-risk predatory scam call or message is blocked.",privacyWhatCaregiverNeverSeesTitle:"What your caregiver CAN NEVER see:",privacyWhatCaregiverNeverSees1:"\u2022 Never sees your private SMS, WhatsApp messages, or conversations.",privacyWhatCaregiverNeverSees2:"\u2022 Never sees your OTPs, PINs, passwords, or bank balances.",privacyWhatCaregiverNeverSees3:"\u2022 Never tracks your location or private telephone calls."},scamSimulator:{title:"Scam Simulator",subtitle:"Interactive Fraud Recognition Practice",tabPractice:"Practice Scenarios",tabDashboard:"Learning Dashboard",progressTitle:"Practice Progress",progressCount:"Scenario {{current}} of {{total}}",scoreLabel:"Completed: {{completed}} of {{total}}",scenarioLabel:"Scenario {{number}}: {{title}}",scenarioDescriptionLabel:"Suspicious Situation:",questionLabel:"What is the safest action to take?",choiceSafeLabel:"Safe Action",choiceDangerLabel:"Dangerous Action",feedbackCorrect:"\u2713 Safe Choice! Excellent Decision",feedbackIncorrect:"\u26a0\ufe0f Danger! Scam Trap",explanationTitle:"Why this is a scam:",nextScenarioButton:"Next Scenario \u2192",finishButton:"\ud83c\udf89 Complete Practice",restartButton:"\ud83d\udd04 Practice Again from Beginning",viewDashboardButton:"View Learning Dashboard \ud83d\udcca",completionBannerTitle:"Congratulations! All Scenarios Completed",completionBannerDesc:"You have successfully learned how to spot India's top 8 digital scam techniques: Electricity Cutoff threats, Fake Digital Arrest, KYC Expiry links, OTP & UPI PIN fraud, Parcel Delivery phishing, Malicious APKs, QR Code scams, and Fake Customer Care numbers.",dashboardTitle:"Awareness & Learning Dashboard",dashboardSubtitle:"Your Digital Scam Reflexes & Progress",accuracyTitle:"Safe Decision Reflex",accuracyScore:"{{accuracy}}% Safe Reflexes",accuracyDetail:"{{correct}} of {{total}} scenarios answered correctly",completedCount:"{{completed}} of {{total}} Topics Explored",masteredSectionTitle:"Topics Mastered",masteredDesc:"You correctly recognized scam tactics in these areas:",improvementSectionTitle:"Areas to Strengthen",improvementDesc:"Remember these helpful safety habits:",noImprovementsNeeded:"\ud83c\udf1f Outstanding awareness! You identified every trap correctly.",practiceMorePrompt:"Practice makes safety a natural reflex. Retake scenarios any time.",retakePracticeButton:"\ud83d\udd04 Practice Scenarios Again",continuePracticeButton:"\ud83c\udfae Continue Practice ({{remaining}} Left)",topicBadge:"Topic: {{topic}}"},callGuardian:{title:"Call Guardian",subtitle:"Offline Threat Screening",status:"Offline Threat Database Active",screenIncoming:"Screening Calls Automatically",lastSynced:"Threat Database: Up to date",statusCardTitle:"Threat Database Status",statusSynced:"Database Up to Date",statusOutdated:"Database Outdated (Sync Required)",statusNotSynced:"Not Yet Synchronized",threatCount:"{{count}} verified scam numbers active",zeroThreats:"0 verified threat signatures stored",lastSyncLabel:"Last sync: ",neverSynced:"Never synchronized",syncButton:"\ud83d\udd04 Sync Threat Database",syncing:"Synchronizing Threat Database...",syncSuccess:"Threat database successfully synchronized!",syncError:"Synchronization failed: ",safeByDefaultTitle:"Safe-By-Default Caller Policy",safeByDefaultDesc:"Unknown callers are allowed through by default so you never miss calls from doctors, family, or legitimate delivery persons. Only verified predatory numbers in the offline database are blocked.",spoofingWarningTitle:"Caller ID Spoofing Warning",spoofingWarningDesc:"Criminals can sometimes spoof or fake legitimate phone numbers. If an unknown caller claims to be your bank manager or police, hang up and call official numbers directly.",noAudioListenTitle:"Zero Audio Interception",noAudioListenDesc:"ScamShield never listens to, analyzes, or records your private telephone calls.",callHistoryTitle:"Call History Privacy",callHistoryDesc:"Call history is not tracked or accessed on this device. Screening occurs strictly at the moment an incoming call rings, 100% offline."},scamLens:{title:"Scam Lens",subtitle:"QR Code & Document Inspector",tabQr:"QR Code Inspector",tabDocument:"Paper Letter / Notice",qrInputLabel:"QR Code Content or Destination",qrInputPlaceholder:"Paste or enter decoded QR text (UPI link or website URL)...",pasteQrButton:"\ud83d\udccb Paste QR Data",clearButton:"\u2715 Clear",inspectQrButton:"\ud83d\udd0d Inspect QR Safety",sampleUpiButton:"Sample Suspicious UPI",sampleUrlButton:"Sample Phishing Link",qrResultTitle:"QR Safety Inspection Result",upiRecipientLabel:"Recipient UPI ID",upiNameLabel:"Recipient Name",upiAmountLabel:"Requested Amount",upiNoteLabel:"Payment Note",noPaymentWarning:"CRITICAL: Scanning a QR code only SENDS money out of your account. You NEVER need to scan a QR code to receive money or get a refund.",noAutoOpenNotice:"ScamShield never automatically opens web links or initiates payments.",documentInputLabel:"Document or Notice Text",documentInputPlaceholder:"Type or paste text from the physical letter, electricity notice, or court summon...",inspectDocumentButton:"\ud83d\udd0d Inspect Document for Scam Patterns",sampleNoticeButton:"Sample Fake Electricity Notice",ocrUnavailableNotice:"On-device camera OCR is active in APK builds. Please enter or paste the text from your paper letter or notice below.",documentResultTitle:"Document Fraud Analysis",errorEmpty:"Please enter or paste QR or document content before inspecting."},messageGuardian:{t