 Messages & Listen to Safety Advice",micButtonStart:"\ud83c\udfa4 Tap to Speak",micButtonStop:"\u23f9\ufe0f Stop Listening",stateIdle:"Ready to Listen",stateListening:"Listening... Speak your message clearly",stateProcessing:"Transcribing your voice...",stateSpeaking:"Speaking safety advice...",stateError:"Voice Error",transcriptionSectionTitle:"Transcribed Message",transcriptionPlaceholder:"Your spoken words will appear here. You can review and edit before analyzing.",reviewInstruction:"Review the transcribed message above. ScamShield never submits your speech without your confirmation.",clearText:"\u2715 Clear Text",analyzeButton:"\ud83d\udd0d Analyze Spoken Message",analyzing:"Evaluating Scam Indicators...",quickSamplesTitle:"Try a Voice Sample",sampleElectricity:"\u26a1 Electricity Cutoff Threat",samplePolice:"\ud83d\udea8 Digital Arrest Video Call",sampleOtp:"\ud83c\udfe6 Bank Account Verification",fallbackTitle:"Manual Text Fallback",fallbackSubtitle:"If voice input is unavailable or your surroundings are noisy, you can type or paste the message directly.",listenAdviceButton:"\ud83d\udd0a Listen to Safety Advice",stopAdviceButton:"\u23f9\ufe0f Stop Reading",permissionRationaleTitle:"Microphone Access Required",permissionRationaleDesc:"ScamShield needs microphone access solely to transcribe what you say. We never record phone calls, secretly listen in the background, or save audio recordings.",permissionDeniedError:"Microphone permission was denied. You can still type or paste your message below.",noAudioCallNotice:"NOTE: ScamShield does not listen to incoming telephone calls. We do not claim cloned-voice or deepfake audio detection.",speechVsScamNotice:"Speech-to-text turns your voice into text. Scam detection is performed by our deterministic rule-based engine.",errorEmpty:"Please speak or enter a message before analyzing.",errorNetwork:"Could not connect to analysis service. Please check your network connection and try again."},bankingSandbox:{title:"Banking & UPI Practice Sandbox",subtitle:"Safe, realistic simulations of digital banking and UPI",demoBanner:"DEMO / TRAINING SIMULATION \u2014 NO REAL MONEY",demoBannerSub:"Safe Practice Sandbox \u2014 Zero Real Credentials or Financial Risk",entryCardTitle:"Banking & UPI Practice Sandbox",entryCardSubtitle:"Practise spotting fake net-banking logins, UPI collect frauds & OTP traps in a safe sandbox.",entryCardBadge:"NEW PRACTICE",startSandboxButton:"Open Banking Sandbox \u2192",scenarioProgress:"Step {{current}} of {{total}}",mockBrowserNotice:"Simulated Web Browser View",mockUpiNotice:"Simulated UPI App View",mockPhoneNotice:"Simulated Phone Call & SMS View",goldenRuleTitle:"Key Security Lesson",dangerSignsTitle:"Scam Indicators to Spot",selectActionTitle:"What is the safest action?",safeChoiceBadge:"\u2713 SAFE PRACTICE DECISION",dangerChoiceBadge:"\u26a0\ufe0f DANGEROUS ACTION / SCAM TRAP",nextScenarioButton:"Next Scenario \u2192",viewResultsButton:"View Practice Results \ud83d\udcca",resultsTitle:"Sandbox Practice Results",resultsSubtitle:"Review your safety reflexes across banking & UPI scenarios",scoreLabel:"Your Practice Score",perfectScoreMessage:"Outstanding Reflexes! You avoided every trap and protected your funds.",goodScoreMessage:"Good effort! Review the key rules below to stay completely secure.",reviewSectionTitle:"Scenario Review & Key Takeaways",retakeButton:"\ud83d\udd04 Re-take Sandbox Practice",backToLearnButton:"Back to Learning Center",disclaimerFooter:"ScamShield never connects to real banks or payment networks. Never enter real PINs or passwords in any practice tool."},audioVisualLearning:{title:"Audio-Visual Learning Centre",subtitle:"Interactive multimedia lessons with voice narration and quizzes",entryCardTitle:"Audio-Visual Learning Centre",entryCardSubtitle:"Master cyber fraud prevention with voice-guided lessons and quizzes.",entryCardBadge:"8 MODULES",openButton:"Explore Learning Modules \u2192",moduleProgressHeader:"Progress: {{completed}} 